=== layout: one-panel

# Your Turn: Tetrad Analysis Handout

@body

- Use the updated unordered tetrad handout provided in class.
- First classify each set and decide whether the genes are linked.
- Calculate distances for linked pairs, one pair at a time.
- For the three-gene mapping problem, choose the middle gene and draw the map.

