=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- All three genes stay visible; classify the pair named in the question.
- Keep earlier pair classifications when you move to the next pair.
- A-B is 10 cM; A-C is 15 cM; B-C is 24 cM.
- A is the middle gene. B-A-C and C-A-B describe the same map.
- The adjacent intervals sum to 25 cM; retain the direct B-C estimate as 24 cM.

